  "colorNotes": {
    "contractKeys": "background…onDanger keep the names used by web/src/ui/tokens.test.ts. They are aliases of the design roles below them.",
    "verdicts": "The design has no verdict colours: verdicts are told apart by marker shape (solid, dotted, dashed, hollow) and their text, always in ink.",
    "danger": "The design has no red. Destructive actions use ink with a trash icon, an outline button and a confirmation sheet; danger = ink.",
    "leave": "Pink is a fill only, for what leaves: bars over hidden values, the Send button, the stamped count, the \"What could leave\" label. Text on pink is onLeave. On butter, paper or the dark-theme butter block, a pink fill gets a 1.5 px onLeave inner border (pink against those grounds is 1.5 to 1.7:1).",
    "lines": "line and blockLine are hairlines (decorative): rgba(ink, .25) light / rgba(cream, .2) dark, shown here as solid equivalents."
  },
