    "sizeSteps": {
      "rule": "Start at the design size. Step down 4 px (headlines) or 2 px (single-line labels, amounts) until no word overflows its line and the headline fits its maximum lines (Start 4, question 4, results title 2, program name 2). Floor: 60% (headlines) or 66% (labels). A primary action label that still does not fit wraps to two lines; a question action row stacks (action above, skip link below).",
